{"route":"/docs/5.3/components/close-button/","version":"5.3","renderedVersion":"5.3","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Close button","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"A generic close button for dismissing content like modals and alerts."},"blocks":[{"id":"example","type":"heading","en":"Example","level":2},{"id":"example--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Provide an option to dismiss or close a component with <code>.btn-close</code>. Default styling is limited, but highly customizable. Modify the Sass variables to replace the default <code>background-image</code>. <strong>Be sure to include text for screen readers</strong>, as we’ve done with <code>aria-label</code>."},{"id":"example--example-1","type":"demo","key":"5ed0e629a2e979df8604","height":147},{"id":"example--code-1","type":"code","value":"<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close\" aria-label=\"Close\"></button>","language":"html"},{"id":"disabled-state","type":"heading","en":"Disabled state","level":2},{"id":"disabled-state--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Disabled close buttons change their <code>opacity</code>. We’ve also applied <code>pointer-events: none</code> and <code>user-select: none</code> to preventing hover and active states from triggering."},{"id":"disabled-state--example-1","type":"demo","key":"bf8455b9ee0699b73520","height":147},{"id":"disabled-state--code-1","type":"code","value":"<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close\" disabled aria-label=\"Close\"></button>","language":"html"},{"id":"dark-variant","type":"heading","en":"Dark variant","level":2},{"id":"dark-variant--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<small>Deprecated in v5.3.0</small>"},{"id":"dark-variant--note-1","type":"note","tone":"warning","body":[{"id":"dark-variant--note-text-1","type":"note-text","en":"<strong>Heads up!</strong> As of v5.3.0, the <code>.btn-close-white</code> class is deprecated. Instead, use <code>data-bs-theme=&quot;dark&quot;</code> to change the color mode of the close button."}]},{"id":"dark-variant--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Add <code>data-bs-theme=&quot;dark&quot;</code> to the <code>.btn-close</code>, or to its parent element, to invert the close button. This uses the <code>filter</code> property to invert the <code>background-image</code> without overriding its value."},{"id":"dark-variant--example-1","type":"demo","key":"8f44bbe678f6205f0902","height":147},{"id":"dark-variant--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div data-bs-theme=\"dark\">\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close\" aria-label=\"Close\"></button>\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close\" disabled aria-label=\"Close\"></button>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"css","type":"heading","en":"CSS","level":2},{"id":"variables","type":"heading","en":"Variables","level":3},{"id":"variables--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<small>Added in v5.3.0</small>"},{"id":"variables--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"As part of Bootstrap’s evolving CSS variables approach, close button now uses local CSS variables on <code>.btn-close</code> for enhanced real-time customization. Values for the CSS variables are set via Sass, so Sass customization is still supported, too."},{"id":"variables--code-1","type":"code","value":"--#{$prefix}btn-close-color: #{$btn-close-color};\n--#{$prefix}btn-close-bg: #{ escape-svg($btn-close-bg) };\n--#{$prefix}btn-close-opacity: #{$btn-close-opacity};\n--#{$prefix}btn-close-hover-opacity: #{$btn-close-hover-opacity};\n--#{$prefix}btn-close-focus-shadow: #{$btn-close-focus-shadow};\n--#{$prefix}btn-close-focus-opacity: #{$btn-close-focus-opacity};\n--#{$prefix}btn-close-disabled-opacity: #{$btn-close-disabled-opacity};","language":"scss"},{"id":"sass-variables","type":"heading","en":"Sass variables","level":3},{"id":"sass-variables--code-1","type":"code","value":"$btn-close-width:            1em;\n$btn-close-height:           $btn-close-width;\n$btn-close-padding-x:        .25em;\n$btn-close-padding-y:        $btn-close-padding-x;\n$btn-close-color:            $black;\n$btn-close-bg:               url(\"data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 16 16' fill='#{$btn-close-color}'><path d='M.293.293a1 1 0 0 1 1.414 0L8 6.586 14.293.293a1 1 0 1 1 1.414 1.414L9.414 8l6.293 6.293a1 1 0 0 1-1.414 1.414L8 9.414l-6.293 6.293a1 1 0 0 1-1.414-1.414L6.586 8 .293 1.707a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.414'/></svg>\");\n$btn-close-focus-shadow:     $focus-ring-box-shadow;\n$btn-close-opacity:          .5;\n$btn-close-hover-opacity:    .75;\n$btn-close-focus-opacity:    1;\n$btn-close-disabled-opacity: .25;\n$btn-close-filter:           null;\n$btn-close-white-filter:     invert(1) grayscale(100%) brightness(200%); // Deprecated in v5.3.4","language":"scss"}],"demos":[{"key":"5ed0e629a2e979df8604","html":" <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close\" aria-label=\"Close\"></button> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"bf8455b9ee0699b73520","html":" <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close\" disabled=\"\" aria-label=\"Close\"></button> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"8f44bbe678f6205f0902","html":" <div data-bs-theme=\"dark\">\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close\" aria-label=\"Close\"></button>\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close\" disabled=\"\" aria-label=\"Close\"></button>\n</div> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0 bg-dark"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Introduction","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/introduction"},{"en":"Download","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/download"},{"en":"Contents","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/contents"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/browsers-devices"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/javascript"},{"en":"Webpack","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started